#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid ""
"Cannot undo the preparation of %(mos)s: the remnant transfer %(picks)s is "
"already validated, so the bars are already cut."
msgstr ""
"Подготовката на %(mos)s не може да бъде отменена: трансферът на остатъците "
"%(picks)s е вече валидиран, значи прътите вече са нарязани."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_relabel_bar_ref
msgid "Cutting-plan bar whose remnant this lot relabel belongs to."
msgstr "Прътът от разкроя, чийто остатък е тази смяна на лот."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_remnant_bar_ref
msgid ""
"Cutting-plan bar whose remnant this move carries from the component location"
" to the remnant location."
msgstr ""
"Прътът от разкроя, чийто остатък това движение пренася от локацията на "
"компонентите в остатъчната локация."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_remnant_src_lot_id
msgid ""
"Lot of the bar the remnant is cut from. The remnant transfer waits until "
"this lot has been relabelled to the remnant lot."
msgstr ""
"Лотът на пръта, от който е отрязан остатъкът. Трансферът на остатъка чака, "
"докато този лот бъде сменен към лота на остатъка."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_remnant_lot_id
msgid "Lot of the remnant, named after its length in millimetres."
msgstr "Лотът на остатъка — наречен по дължината му в милиметри."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid ""
"Preparation undone for %(mos)s: %(moves)s remnant move(s) cancelled, "
"%(relabels)s lot relabel(s) reversed."
msgstr ""
"Подготовката на %(mos)s е отменена: отказани движения на остатъци — "
"%(moves)s, върнати смени на лот — %(relabels)s."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid "Remnants %s"
msgstr "Остатъци %s"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid ""
"Some remnants of cutting run %(run)s did not get their own lot and their "
"transfer stays waiting: %(list)s"
msgstr ""
"Някои остатъци от разкрой %(run)s не получиха свой лот и трансферът им "
"остава чакащ: %(list)s"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_relabel_bar_ref
msgid "Staged Relabel Bar"
msgstr "Прът на смяната на лот"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_relabel_undo
msgid "Staged Relabel Undo"
msgstr "Обратна смяна на лот"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_remnant_bar_ref
msgid "Staged Remnant Bar"
msgstr "Прът на остатъка"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_remnant_lot_id
msgid "Staged Remnant Lot"
msgstr "Лот на остатъка"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_remnant_src_lot_id
msgid "Staged Remnant Source Lot"
msgstr "Лот-източник на остатъка"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid ""
"The remnants of cutting run %(run)s were not planned: the remnant location "
"or the component location of %(mo)s is missing."
msgstr ""
"Остатъците от разкрой %(run)s не са планирани: липсва остатъчната локация "
"или локацията на компонентите на %(mo)s."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_relabel_undo
msgid "This lot relabel reverses an earlier one (Undo Preparation)."
msgstr "Тази смяна на лот връща по-ранна (отмяна на подготовката)."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid "only %(free)s of lot %(lot)s is free in %(loc)s, %(qty)s needed"
msgstr "само %(free)s от лот %(lot)s са свободни в %(loc)s, нужни са %(qty)s"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid "the source bar lot is unknown"
msgstr "лотът на пръта-източник не е известен"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_offcut_src_lot_id
msgid "Staged Old Remnant Lot"
msgstr "Лот на стар остатък (подготовка)"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_offcut_src_lot_id
msgid ""
"Existing remnant lot this preparation pick carries from the remnant location"
" into the buffer, like a full bar."
msgstr ""
"Съществуващият лот на остатък, който този пик на подготовката пренася от "
"локацията за остатъци в буфера — като цял прът."

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_offcut_production_id
msgid "Staged Old Remnant Order"
msgstr "Поръчка на стария остатък (подготовка)"

#. module: mrp_production_staged_preparation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_production_staged_preparation.field_stock_move__staged_offcut_production_id
msgid ""
"Manufacturing order whose preparation carries this old remnant into the "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"Производствената поръчка, чиято подготовка пренася този стар остатък в "
"буфера."

#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid ""
"Cannot undo the preparation: the transfer %(picks)s is already partly done —"
" the bars are already on the table."
msgstr ""
"Подготовката не може да се отмени: трансферът %(picks)s вече е частично "
"изпълнен — прътите вече са на масата."

#: code:addons/mrp_production_staged_preparation/models/mrp_production.py:0
msgid ""
"The transfer %(picks)s also carries %(others)s. Undo the preparation of all "
"these orders together — undoing only some of them would leave the transfer "
"half-emptied."
msgstr ""
"Трансферът %(picks)s носи и %(others)s. Отменете подготовката на всички тези"
" поръчки заедно — отмяна само на част от тях би оставила трансфера "
"наполовина празен."
